# Only what the agent runs goes into the image.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.trivyignore
Dockerfile
mise.toml
*.md
**/*.md
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*

# Developer-only. examples/stub-bin/ ships fake `az`, `np` and `tofu`
# executables for the offline unit tests — they must never travel in an image
# that runs real actions, even unreachable from PATH.
**/examples/

# Operator-side terraform (registers the service; never runs on the agent).
**/specs/install/
